/**
 * The illustrators, as credited by the person who supplied the pictures. The set was
 * handed over as a group rather than image by image, so the names are listed as a
 * group: pairing them to individual files would be a guess dressed as attribution.
 * Kept in the picker as a collapsed <details> so the credit is present without
 * standing in front of the pictures.
 */
